{"id":"n17884-3-7","stage":1,"title":"새 · 新的","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17884-3-7-1","ko":"엄마, 넘어져서 옷이 찢어졌어요.","zh":"妈妈，我摔倒了，衣服被撕坏了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"넘어져서","meaning":"跌倒，倒下，摔倒","explanation":"넘어지다：跌倒，倒下，摔倒；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"넘어지다","audio":"/audio/b95cf11ab79489dac5a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62363","senseId":"1","lemma":"넘어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넘어져서","audio":"/audio/10787ebb24047b5bd969.mp3"}},{"text":"옷이","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷이","audio":"/audio/4ed934dde6defcc6f810.mp3"}},{"text":"찢어졌어요.","meaning":"被撕开，被撕破","explanation":"찢어지다：被撕开，被撕破；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"찢어지다","audio":"/audio/0effd3aa896496d2b929.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37225","senseId":"1","lemma":"찢어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찢어졌어요","audio":"/audio/1fefcdddc73e1af24298.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"b95cf11ab79489da","term":"넘어지다","zh":"跌倒，倒下，摔倒","audio":"/audio/b95cf11ab79489dac5a0.mp3","entryId":"62363","definition":"站立着的人或物失去重心，倾向一边而倒下。","pronunciation":["너머지다"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"0effd3aa896496d2","term":"찢어지다","zh":"被撕开，被撕破","audio":"/audio/0effd3aa896496d2b929.mp3","entryId":"37225","definition":"被用工具等扯住弄得破裂。","pronunciation":["찌저지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/360dbc53dcba45a7d2a0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n17884-3-7-2","ko":"어제 산 새 옷인데 조심 좀 하지 그랬어.","zh":"那是昨天刚买的新衣服，你怎么不小心点呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"산","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3"}},{"text":"새","meaning":"新的","explanation":"새：新的","readings":[{"term":"새","audio":"/audio/e2d38c50201cf36dbda0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17884","senseId":"3","lemma":"새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새","audio":"/audio/e2d38c50201cf36dbda0.mp3"}},{"text":"옷인데","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷인데","audio":"/audio/a3f81f53cc7086cfb3e0.mp3"}},{"text":"조심","meaning":"小心，谨慎，留心","explanation":"조심：小心，谨慎，留心","readings":[{"term":"조심","audio":"/audio/55fa97dd5c7e75be2560.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75344","senseId":"1","lemma":"조심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조심","audio":"/audio/55fa97dd5c7e75be2560.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"하지","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하지","audio":"/audio/e16a62e07a7c6fa42e9f.mp3"}},{"text":"그랬어.","meaning":"早该……的（-지 그랬어）","explanation":"그렇다：那样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。；-지 그랬어 常表示本该那样做的遗憾、责备或建议；本句是“你怎么没小心点”。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그랬어","audio":"/audio/d60557f7f56a03856469.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"e2d38c50201cf36d","term":"새","zh":"新的","audio":"/audio/e2d38c50201cf36dbda0.mp3","entryId":"17884","definition":"使用或购买后没多久的。","pronunciation":["새"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"55fa97dd5c7e75be","term":"조심","zh":"小心，谨慎，留心","audio":"/audio/55fa97dd5c7e75be2560.mp3","entryId":"75344","definition":"为避免惹祸而注意言行。","pronunciation":["조ː심"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/5272d377cbf76aff925d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.627,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=17884","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"초급","day":44,"sequenceScore":1.9672,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["妈妈，我把刚洗好的衣服弄湿了。","妈妈，我摔倒了，衣服被撕坏了。","妈妈，我跑丢了昨天买的衣服。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那是很旧的衣服，弄破也没关系。","我昨天就让你把那件旧衣服扔掉。","那是昨天刚买的新衣服，你怎么不小心点呢。"],"answer":2}]}
